    "commit": {
      "message": "Add Debug Workbench D5 transfer and notification debugger"
    },
    "notes": [
      "D5 adds a state-derived transfer lifecycle, backend, notification, completed open-file, and failure-label debugger under Settings > Debug Workbench.",
      "The debugger is read-only and does not pause, resume, cancel, retry, enqueue, start activities, launch viewers, probe files, open schemes, or upload reports.",
      "Normal UI uses human labels and the copy report redacts URLs and fingerprints destination URI."
